4
00:02:27,719 --> 00:02:29,680
He's forcing me into a corner.

5
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,000
Calm down.

6
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,719
Don't be angry.

7
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,280
We'll figure out a solution.

8
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,800
I have to beat Kista.

9
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,280
Cheng An won't let me have it easy,

10
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,719
so I won't let him have it easy either.

11
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,439
I see it clearly now.

12
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,800
Rather than cooperating with him,

13
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,120
I'm better off relying on myself.

14
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,080
I'll let him know

15
00:02:57,639 --> 00:02:59,199
that even without Cheng An,

16
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,479
I, Lin Wanmei, can still

17
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:03,240
stand firm in Gufeng Group.

18
00:03:09,759 --> 00:03:10,400
Luoluo.

19
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,039
Come here.

20
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:12,280
Auntie Lin.

21
00:03:17,759 --> 00:03:18,560
Here.

22
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,800
Taste my wine.

23
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,759
How is it?

24
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:34,960
The yeasty aroma from the sur lie aging

25
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,560
is faintly present at the finish.

26
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,599
The proportion of oak barrels used

27
00:03:38,599 --> 00:03:40,759
