28
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,560
Auntie Lin's winemaking skills

29
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,479
certainly live up to their reputation.

30
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,159
Sang Luo.

31
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:48,599
You seem to know a lot about red wine.

32
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,520
How did you manage that?

33
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:53,639
It's just that

34
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,080
Yi Kai

35
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:58,039
