36
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,120
After tasting so many,

37
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,719
I naturally picked up a few things.

38
00:04:01,319 --> 00:04:02,639
I see.

39
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:07,719
How do you think I compare with Kista?

40
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:09,360
What's the difference between us?

41
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,120
Auntie Lin, today,

42
00:04:16,879 --> 00:04:18,759
you didn't just invite me for wine, right?

43
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,360
What do you think?

44
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,079
I think

45
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,920
Auntie's early wines

46
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:32,519
are quite stunning in many ways.

47
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,480
They have a distinct style

48
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,680
and a strong personality.

49
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:38,680
As for Kista's wines, needless to say,

50
00:04:38,759 --> 00:04:40,920
her selection of grape varieties

51
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,600
and her winemaking techniques

52
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,759
are strictly controlled.

53
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,439
Every wine is like a work of art.

54
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,959
So,

55
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,800
both of your wines

56
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,399
have their own merits.

57
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,639
Actually,

58
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,000
today, I

59
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:01,720
specially prepared a gift for you.

60
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,519
This is too valuable.

61
00:05:04,519 --> 00:05:05,240
Auntie,

62
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,800
I can't accept this.

63
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,720
Don't be so polite with me.

64
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:12,959
I prepared it especially for you.

65
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,319
I hope you like it.

66
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,759
I like it.

67
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:21,519
Actually,

68
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:24,000
today,

69
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,879
there's something I need your help with.

70
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,199
I know you're close with Yi Kai.

71
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,600
I want you to help me get

72
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
info on Kista's latest red wine.

73
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:35,720
Ideally, if you could get me a few bottles

74
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,199
of Kista's unreleased wines.

75
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,360
You know what they say.

76
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,399
Know your enemy and know yourself,

77
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,759
and you will win every battle.

78
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,079
Well...

79
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,519
Luoluo.

80
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,800
Honestly,

81
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,800
I've devoted my life to the Cheng family all these years.

82
00:05:57,639 --> 00:05:59,279
Ever since your dad passed away,

83
00:06:00,759 --> 00:06:03,120
I've felt like a useless person.

84
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:05,759
But Gufeng Group is your dad's life's work.

85
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,160
He left it to you and your brother.

86
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,480
I can't just stand by

87
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:10,959
and watch others take it away.

88
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,439
I will definitely protect it for you.

89
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:14,920
But,

90
00:06:15,959 --> 00:06:17,680
