91
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,279
Auntie,

92
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:25,879
don't worry.

93
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,680
I'll do my best.

94
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:30,560
Good.

95
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,519
Grandma.

96
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,720
Swimming helps you relax.

97
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,360
You know me best.

98
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:18,240
With so much happening at home recently,

99
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,720
I've been feeling really upset.

100
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,560
Only you

101
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,839
are considerate enough

102
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,839
to think of bringing Grandma out for fun.

103
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,920
Mrs. Cheng.

104
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,560
Ms. Sang.

105
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,879
Isn't that Coach Shen, who taught you frisbee?

106
00:07:28,879 --> 00:07:29,600
Yes, it is.

107
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,160
Why is he here?

108
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:32,519
Mrs. Cheng.

109
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,319
Ms. Sang.

110
00:07:33,319 --> 00:07:34,120
Long time no see.

111
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,680
I didn't expect to run into you here.

112
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,319
Coach Shen, are you...

113
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,439
I'm also a part-time swim coach.

114
00:07:39,639 --> 00:07:41,120
What a coincidence.

115
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,720
Since Coach Shen is here,

116
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:45,160
