117
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:48,399
You can go take a rest then.

118
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:54,600
Then shall we...

119
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,839
Let's practice.

120
00:08:10,199 --> 00:08:11,000
Careful.

121
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:14,199
Lin Wanmei has successfully blended Kista's wine.

122
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:15,439
Excellent.

123
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,079
Lin Wanmei.

124
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:20,079
Let's see how you talk your way out of this.

125
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,199
It's okay.

126
00:08:23,240 --> 00:08:23,639
Don't be afraid.

127
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:24,759
Careful.

128
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:38,320
Easy, easy.

129
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,240
Here, let me help you.

130
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,080
Good. Good. Very good.

131
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,399
What a beautiful day.

132
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:06,480
The fruity aroma and the scent of oak

133
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,679
instantly spread across the palate.

134
00:09:08,759 --> 00:09:10,440
The texture of the tannin is also perfect.

135
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,600
And the finish is long.

136
00:09:12,039 --> 00:09:12,879
This wine

137
00:09:12,879 --> 00:09:14,960
has perfectly replicated Kista red wine's

138
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,399
essence and soul.

139
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:20,159
The lab in California

140
00:09:20,159 --> 00:09:22,759
analyzed the wine's chemical composition,

141
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,720
and then made adjustments

142
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,840
to chemically replicate the original.

143
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,200
I want everyone to know

144
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,279
that whatever Kista can do,

145
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:34,960
I can do too.

146
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:39,480
Wanmei,

147
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:40,879
this wine

148
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,159
is indeed very good.

149
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:43,799
But you must know,

150
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,240
replicating red wine

151
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,080
has a huge impact on one's reputation.

152
00:09:47,519 --> 00:09:48,799
Once the public finds out,

153
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,679
won't your reputation be ruined?

154
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:52,679
I'm also developing new products myself.

155
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,240
My new products

156
00:09:54,679 --> 00:09:55,840
can help you too.

157
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:01,960
Can your wine

158
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,440
surpass Kista's?

159
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:06,279
Can it help me defeat her in a short time?

160
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:12,279
I won't admit defeat.

161
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:15,679
I've suffered for years at Gufeng Group.

162
00:10:15,759 --> 00:10:17,240
I must prove myself.

163
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,519
I want everyone to know

164
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,799
that I, Lin Wanmei,

165
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,720
am not to be messed with.

166
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:28,240
This family is like a den of wolves.

167
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:31,360
Everyone is playing their own hidden game.

168
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:33,440
Calculating every move,

169
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,679
