170
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,440
I only feel at peace when I'm here with you.

171
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:44,320
Dongdong,

172
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,039
I thought about it,

173
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:47,120
and you still have to leave.

174
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,559
I asked experts abroad.

175
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,440
They said there's still a chance you can stand again.

176
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,159
Sang Luo,

177
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:01,360
why are you so good to me?

178
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:05,360
Because you're not just family to me,

179
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:07,240
