180
00:11:09,039 --> 00:11:09,840
Yeah.

181
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,799
I want you to live well,

182
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:15,240
have a healthy body,

183
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:17,840
and be able to pursue the life you want.

184
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,399
Sang Luo,

185
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,879
I'm grateful for everything you've done.

186
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:32,879
But right now,

187
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:34,799
I don't want to leave yet.

188
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:37,120
Because here,

189
00:11:37,799 --> 00:11:39,279
