190
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:41,600
I don't want

191
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:45,639
to leave when she needs me.

192
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,639
Sang Luo,

193
00:11:55,159 --> 00:11:57,039
once I've decided when to leave,

194
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:58,320
I will definitely

195
00:11:58,679 --> 00:12:00,039
tell you right away.

196
00:12:01,799 --> 00:12:02,600
Okay.

197
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:05,440
Then keep yourself safe.

198
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,600
You hear me?

199
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:27,960
I've noticed

200
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,679
that only when you're with Dongdong

201
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:31,679
