203
00:12:35,159 --> 00:12:36,360
Were you eavesdropping on us,

204
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,120
Little Uncle?

205
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,960
The thorns of a rose

206
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:43,200
never prick those who admire it.

207
00:12:43,879 --> 00:12:44,679
They only pierce

208
00:12:44,679 --> 00:12:46,320
the ones who try to control

209
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,559
and pluck it.

210
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,759
Sometimes I wonder,

211
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:53,200
as your Little Uncle,

212
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,759
I haven't been too bad to you, right?

213
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:56,679
But why do you always

214
00:12:56,799 --> 00:12:58,000
