215
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:01,080
When you, Little Uncle, can tolerate me

216
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:03,039
just as you tolerate yourself,

217
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,080
maybe then I'll treat you better.

218
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,320
So after all that,

219
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,440
it's somehow my fault.

220
00:13:13,279 --> 00:13:14,080
I came here

221
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,440
just to tell you

222
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,399
that next week, Lin Wanmei

223
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,559
has decided to host a

224
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:20,639
Gufeng Group's new product Wine Tasting.

225
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,120
This is very important to Gufeng Group.

226
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:25,559
It should go smoothly, right?

227
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,039
Of course.

228
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,919
Rest assured, Little Uncle.

229
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,559
I promise

230
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:34,519
there will be a surprise beyond your expectations.

231
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,679
I'll look forward to it then.

232
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:58,279
I wonder what the new product is this time.

233
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,360
Everyone.

234
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,080
Welcome to our

235
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,519
intimate Wine Tasting.

236
00:14:05,919 --> 00:14:06,759
Today...

237
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:08,919
Today, I'm highly honored to present this

238
00:14:08,919 --> 00:14:10,320
new red wine,

239
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:11,360
Enchanted Dream.

240
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,000
This wine

241
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,799
blends the essence of various grapes,

242
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:16,360
and in its winemaking techniques,

243
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,840
it also features bold innovations.

244
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:18,919
I hope

245
00:14:18,919 --> 00:14:19,840
it will bring you all

246
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,519
a unique tasting experience.

247
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:23,440
Cheers!

248
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:25,840
Cheers!

249
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,559
The aftertaste is indeed different.

250
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:32,919
Ms. Lin,

251
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:34,480
I just tasted your

252
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,600
Enchanted Dream red wine,

253
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,799
and found

254
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:38,320
its taste to be very unique.

255
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,279
Has this red wine

256
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:41,799
