260
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:56,840
No improper adulteration is involved.

261
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,200
If that's the case,

262
00:14:58,559 --> 00:15:00,080
why don't you show us

263
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,279
this red wine's

264
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,480
R&D records

265
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,600
and winemaking process,

266
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,000
so we can

267
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,159
