271
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,399
Hello, everyone.

272
00:15:17,919 --> 00:15:18,840
Let me say a few words.

273
00:15:19,159 --> 00:15:20,039
I am Cheng An.

274
00:15:20,600 --> 00:15:22,919
Gufeng Group has always valued integrity.

275
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,840
Regarding this accusation,

276
00:15:25,279 --> 00:15:26,919
