277
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:28,080
Please rest assured.

278
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,519
Thank you all.

279
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,799
Yes, it must be thoroughly investigated!

280
00:15:33,519 --> 00:15:35,200
Mr. Cheng is still trustworthy.

281
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,559
What are you doing!

282
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,759
Hello, everyone.

283
00:15:51,799 --> 00:15:52,840
I am Sang Luo,

284
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:54,960
and also a daughter of the Cheng family.

285
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,720
Regarding today's red wine,

286
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,840
I can tell you all very clearly

287
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,919
that it is indeed adulterated.

288
00:16:02,639 --> 00:16:03,440
Adulterated?

289
00:16:03,799 --> 00:16:05,480
It really is adulterated!

290
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,039
